  "description": "Connects the OASIS to PlanetScale (serverless MySQL) using MySqlConnector ADO.NET. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with indexed lookup columns and full JSON blob storage. Compatible with PlanetScale cloud and any MySQL 8+ instance. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
