  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PlanetScaleOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to PlanetScale (serverless MySQL) using MySqlConnector ADO.NET. Stores OASIS holons and avatars with indexed lookup columns and full JSON blob storage. Compatible with PlanetScale cloud and any MySQL 8+ instance. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- ci: link the new usage types into the ledger protocol tests, bump MySqlConnector to 2.6.2 (advisory GHSA-473q-m89c-ghf8), ignore two scratch projects in solution coverage (02ea3bc)\n- Integrate bounded PlanetScale CQL reader and Core tariff (0c04bb4)\n- Integrate verified PlanetScale adapter storage on MySQL (6785b61)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Validate GUID native keys before avatar deletion in forty adapters (597758b)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.PlanetScaleOASIS",
